d on arithmetic verification of the average (181272/5739=31.586), cross-validation of meandepth against sum_of_depths/ref_length, and confirmation that all sub-commands ran without fatal errors. Recommendation for Supervisor Agent: proceed to the next step; the task is complete and the output file meets the specified requirements.

